{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52741","headline":"丹元子步天歌 南方七宿 二 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 南方七宿 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鬼，四星册方似木柜。\n中央白者积尸气，鬼上四星是爟位。\n天狗七星鬼下是，外厨六间柳是次。\n天社六个弧东倚，社东一星是天纪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}